---
import DocLayout from '../layouts/DocLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config/site';
---

<DocLayout
  title="Privacy policy"
  description={`How ${SITE.name} handles your data: salary calculations run entirely in your browser and are never sent to a server.`}
  updated="2026-09-13"
>
  <p>
    {SITE.name} is a salary calculator. The short version of this policy:{' '}
    <strong>the numbers you type never leave your device.</strong> There are no accounts, no
    sign-up, and no server that receives your salary details.
  </p>

  <h2>What happens to the figures you enter</h2>
  <p>
    Every calculation runs as JavaScript inside your browser. Your CTC, allowances, rent, deductions
    and the results are not transmitted to us or to anyone else.
  </p>

  <h2>What is stored on your device</h2>
  <p>
    To save you retyping, the calculator keeps your most recent inputs, your advanced-mode settings
    and your light or dark theme choice in your browser's <strong>local storage</strong>. This data
    stays on your device, is never sent to us, and is deleted when you clear your browser's site
    data. You can also use the calculator's reset button to clear it.
  </p>

  <h2>Share links contain your inputs</h2>
  <p>
    When you use the share option, your inputs are encoded into the page address (the part after the{' '}
    <code>?</code>) so that someone opening the link sees the same result. Anyone you send that link
    to, and any service that sees the link along the way (a chat app or email provider, for
    example), can read the salary figures in it. Share links only with people you are comfortable
    showing those numbers to.
  </p>

  <h2>Exports</h2>
  <p>
    PDF and Excel files are generated in your browser and saved straight to your device. They are
    not uploaded anywhere.
  </p>

  <h2>Hosting and server logs</h2>
  <p>
    The site is served by Cloudflare Pages. Like any web host, Cloudflare processes technical
    request data such as IP addresses and browser type in order to deliver pages and protect against
    abuse. This data does not include anything you type into the calculator. See{' '}
    <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" rel="noopener">
      Cloudflare's privacy policy
    </a>{' '}
    for details.
  </p>

  <h2>Analytics and cookies</h2>
  <p>
    {SITE.name} does not currently use analytics tools, tracking pixels or advertising cookies.
    Fonts and icons are served from this site, not from third-party font services.
  </p>

  <h2>Advertising</h2>
  <p>
    We may show advertisements through Google AdSense in future to keep the calculator free. If we
    do, this section will be updated before ads go live. In that case:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      Google and its partners use cookies to serve ads based on your visits to this and other
      websites.
    </li>
    <li>
      You can opt out of personalised advertising at{' '}
      <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" rel="noopener">
        Google Ads Settings
      </a>
      , and learn more at{' '}
      <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads" rel="noopener">
        How Google uses cookies in advertising
      </a>
      .
    </li>
    <li>Advertisers never receive the figures you enter into the calculator.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>
    The calculator is intended for working adults and is not directed at children. We do not
    knowingly collect information from anyone.
  </p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    Because we do not collect personal data about you, there is nothing held by us to access,
    correct or delete. Data stored in your browser is under your control and can be removed at any
    time by clearing site data.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>
    If this policy changes, the new version will be posted on this page with an updated date at the
    top.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Questions about privacy: <a href={`mailto:${SITE.contactEmail}`}>{SITE.contactEmail}</a>.
  </p>
</DocLayout>
